{"3125400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FightArena", "steam_appid": 3125400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the arena and unleash your inner champion in FightArena — a thrilling arena fighter where strategy, skill, and sheer willpower reign supreme. As a fearless fighter, you'll face off against formidable opponents in intense, fast-paced combat, battling for glory and valuable stakes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRIENDLY MATCH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight ONLINE against a friend to find out who is the better Arena Fighter, but be careful tho, he might have a better outfit than yours. No worries, you can attain better GEAR by playing the following game modes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUEL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fighter refine your combat techniques, and build a legacy in a ONLINE world where only the strongest survive. Whether you're a seasoned fighter or a newcomer to the arena, FightArena promises relentless action, epic battles, and endless excitement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUNGEONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate with a FRIEND or ALONE through perilous dungeons teeming with monsters and traps to discover rare loot and powerful artifacts. Every victory earns you not only riches but also enhances your prowess and prepares you for even fiercer challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for battle, claim your honor, and become the ultimate fighter in FightArena!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the arena and unleash your inner champion in FightArena — a thrilling arena fighter where strategy, skill, and sheer willpower r